<title>USA: Strategic Diagnostics names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Strategic Diagnostics names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, Del 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategic Diagnostics Inc said Wednesday it has named Arthur Koch Jr as chief financial officer to succeed Gregory Bell, who resigned April 1.</p>
<p>Strategic Diagnostics said Koch previously had been chief financial officer of biotechnology company Paracelsian Inc. It said he begin his new duties at Strategic Diagnostics April 14.</p>
<p>Strategic Diagnostics provides biotechnology-based diagnostic testing and is also involved in antibody and immunoreagent research and development services.</p>
